{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15212440","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15212440","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521244001:1":{"text":"Solt, that's not how you usually fight.","source_cn":"索斯，这似乎不是你平时的实力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB26C23C5DC939C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521244002:0":{"text":"... Sorry. I'm off my game.","source_cn":"……抱歉，状态不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE209F27F38F8EE78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521244003:0":{"text":"Don't make excuses. You're hurt.","source_cn":"别找借口，受伤就是受伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99920F01848DEACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521244004:0":{"text":"You told Ruu to go home and rest. Now look at you.","source_cn":"鲁受伤的时候你还劝他回去休息，怎么轮到自己就一声不吭了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63510C2CA32CE76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521244005:0":{"text":"It's just a cut. I can handle it.","source_cn":"只是胳膊受了一点伤，不算什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE80940A35540E064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521244006:1":{"text":"And I don't want Bel finding out. He never shuts up.","source_cn":"我也不想被巴知道。那家伙的嘴一向不饶人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B5E8006A984CCB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521244007:1":{"text":"Hmph. You've got some spine, I'll give you that.","source_cn":"哼，你倒是倔得很。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF1E59DBD96C5419","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521244008:1":{"text":"What was the plan then? That beast wasn't going to show mercy.","source_cn":"要是我们不来，你准备怎么对付刚才的暴兽？它可不是吃素的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8B4FCD390206D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521244009:1":{"text":"I had one. If I didn't, I wouldn't be standing here.","source_cn":"我自然有办法。否则就不会在武器脱手后还站在原地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9DF87C512A4AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1521244009":{"text":"I had one. If I didn't, I wouldn't be standing here.","source_cn":"我自然有办法。否则就不会在武器脱手后还站在原地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9DF87C512A4AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521244010:1":{"text":"The beast has two key weaknesses. Know them, and you don't need a weapon.","source_cn":"暴兽有两个弱点。只要知道这两点，没有武器也能对付它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345D7CFAE48AAE61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521244011:1":{"text":"First, their weak spot.\nThe <style=\"highlight\">belly</style>, softest part of their body.","source_cn":"第一个是它身体上的弱点。\\n<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BC945EAD893CE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521244012:1":{"text":"Second, their behavior.\nIf <style=\"highlight\">they think their prey is dead</style>, they drop their guard.","source_cn":"第二个是它习性上的弱点。\\n一旦<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E16471395DFFD69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521244013:1":{"text":"So if you're losing in a fight with it, drop to the ground. Stay still. Let it relax. Then hit it in the belly where it's weakest.","source_cn":"所以独自对战暴兽时，如果落了下风，只要看准时机倒地装死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28967DED132BFC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521244014:1":{"text":"You'll need to wait a while for it to drop its guard, but once it does, this trick always works.","source_cn":"虽然等它完全放松需要一定时间，但这个方法几乎不可能失手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A6C9A6C99CF592D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521244015:1":{"text":"That's... actually clever.","source_cn":"嗯……的确是很有趣的策略。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AEFD2E4C7D6BE19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521244016:1":{"text":"Where'd you learn that?","source_cn":"你是怎么知道这些的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x830139786C79D9D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521244017:1":{"text":"Let's just say I've been on the wrong end of a beast or two.","source_cn":"我有经验……呃，被暴兽袭击的经验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE835F692C35E3B1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521244018:1":{"text":"Back then, I wasn't much of a fighter. Barely knew what I was doing. I had to get creative just to stay alive.","source_cn":"当时的我还不算是个成熟的战士，只能想点别的办法，至少保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5E6FBCD982C74F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1521244018":{"text":"Back then, I wasn't much of a fighter. Barely knew what I was doing. I had to get creative just to stay alive.","source_cn":"当时的我还不算是个成熟的战士，只能想点别的办法，至少保住自己的命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5E6FBCD982C74F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521244019:1":{"text":"Yes...","source_cn":"……是的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x46D03F38AD336FF2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes...","female":"Yes...","variant_male_record_index":"184410","variant_female_record_index":"184411","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521244020:1":{"text":"Yeah. But luckily, it worked. And I learned where to strike.","source_cn":"幸运的是，我赌赢了，还发现了它的弱点。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC9E1519344FEBB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yeah. But luckily, it worked. And I learned where to strike.","female":"Yeah. But luckily, it worked. And I learned where to strike.","variant_male_record_index":"184412","variant_female_record_index":"184413","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521244021:1":{"text":"A smart warrior learns their prey's habits in real combat. You turned the tide with sharp instincts. That's exactly the kind of fighter the Wildborn need.","source_cn":"聪明的战士懂得在实战中摸清猎物的习性。你能逆风翻盘，全...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7665AEF3B9A33D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521244022:1":{"text":"But don't get cocky. You're still injured. Take this medicine.","source_cn":"不过受了伤还是不能马虎。这些伤药你拿着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6F849861D05B829","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521244023:1":{"text":"... Thanks.","source_cn":"……谢谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6652B5B5B9B1A6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521244024:1":{"text":"Thanks. I'll get back to the hunt and make good use of your medicine.","source_cn":"那我就继续捕猎了，尽量不辜负这些伤药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x520CFC19B8FD4DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521244025:0":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, time's almost up. We should <style=\"highlight\">return to camp.</style>","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA638C4C56BAC15","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, time's almost up. We should <style=\"highlight\">return to camp.</style>","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, time's almost up. We should <style=\"highlight\">return to camp.</style>","variant_male_record_index":"184418","variant_female_record_index":"184419","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521244026:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">Once night falls</style>, the others will be back with whatever they caught.","source_cn":"<style=highlight> 等到晚上</sty...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD26E53B7989C0C7B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"highlight\">Once night falls</style>, the others will be back with whatever they caught.","female":"<style=\"highlight\">Once night falls</style>, the others will be back with whatever they caught.","variant_male_record_index":"184420","variant_female_record_index":"184421","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"So you played dead?","source_cn":"所以你选择装死？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF89B86E66F427C9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"So you played dead?","female":"So you played dead?","variant_male_record_index":"78343","variant_female_record_index":"78344","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"Smart move.","source_cn":"很理智的选择","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C01C991835E31FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Smart move.","female":"Smart move.","variant_male_record_index":"78345","variant_female_record_index":"78346","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:2:3":{"text":"You were betting your life.","source_cn":"这是在赌命啊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35B2079495060AAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You were betting your life.","female":"You were betting your life.","variant_male_record_index":"78347","variant_female_record_index":"78348","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"Tell me more!","source_cn":"说来听听","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x09478C0C94043D39","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Tell me more!","female":"Tell me more!","variant_male_record_index":"78339","variant_female_record_index":"78340","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"Don't bluff. We'll know.","source_cn":"你最好不是在逞强","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3E6A3D5EF0505AD4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Don't bluff. We'll know.","female":"Don't bluff. We'll know.","variant_male_record_index":"78341","variant_female_record_index":"78342","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:狩猎队长森绒":{"text":"Captain Tuft","source":"狩猎队长森绒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索斯":{"text":"Solt","source":"索斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":34,"localized_text_count":33,"speaker_count":2}}